# --- Live customer data / runtime state (do not commit PII or secrets) ---
# The whole apps/api/data directory is runtime state written by the API
# container (appeals chat store with customer PII, inventory, product reports).
# It also used to hold printers.json with printer hosts and access codes —
# that config now lives in apps/atelier and must never be committed here again.
apps/api/data/

